The situation is using distance sampling with camera traps, but the maximum detection distance can be different for different cameras due to vegetation or other obstacles at the camera site that will affect the maximum distance at which an animal can be detected. Maximum detection distance has been recorded as between 3.5-7.7m, so there is a relatively large range of values.

Any advice or suggestions would be much appreciated, before I embark on writing some custom code.

Cheers

Darryl

