MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Provided anything very close to the camera and in the field of view gets detected with certainty, then it really doesn’t matter whether the fall-off in the detection function is due to detectability or availability.

David Borchers produced a nice proof of pooling robustness – it’s in the 2004 advanced distance sampling book, pp 390-391.

Steve

